  "outcomes": [
    "Ordinary paid tap/sacrifice activation samples current greatest controlled toughness at resolution; opposing creatures are excluded. Large69999/69999 white Spirit has no counters or flying.",
    "Copying and copying a copy preserve the sampled base while omitting later counters. A later explicit3/3 Golem copy exception replaces the sampled base. A sampled base suppresses a copied P/T CDA before ordinary counter modifiers.",
    "Creating a0/0 token still creates it and SBA removes it; endure0 takes no action.",
    "Entering-recipient Endure samples all hot and sparse source counter kinds at resolution, after responses; chosen counter and token events use ordinary replacements. Elspeth doubles tokens, not the sampled base.",
    "Departed source quantities use final counter LKI and cannot bind a returned source. Recipient current controller chooses and places counters, including Doc Samson qualification in both seats; departed recipient uses controller LKI without binding reentry.",
    "Counter prohibition creates one70000/70000 Spirit automatically.",
    "Pending2^64 quantity survives owned raw/index branches and restore after parent disposal; illegal actor and counter-capacity failure preserve exact snapshot/revision, and the token branch remains usable.",
    "Dynamic source-recipient Endure produces counters or one sampled token, including exact-source departure/reentry fallback."
  ],
